	<section_number>64.2-771</section_number>
	<catch_line>Control and protection of trust property</catch_line>
	<text>
		A trustee shall take reasonable steps to take control of and protect the trust property.
	</text>
	<history>2005, c. 935, § 55-548.09; 2012, c. 614.</history>
